## Builds the player sprite sheet (Player/art/player_sheet.png) from the
## hand-drawn pixel grids below. Edit a grid, then run from the project folder:
##   godot --headless --path . --script res://Player/tools/make_placeholder_sprite.gd
##
## Sheet layout (keep the same layout when swapping in other art):
##   frames are 32 x 52 px, 4 columns: 0 = stand, 1 = step, 2 = stand, 3 = other step
##   rows: 0 = facing down, 1 = facing up, 2 = facing right (left is flipped)
##   the feet stand 2 px above the bottom edge
##
## Grid letters: . empty, K ink, H/Y/B hair light/mid/dark, S/M/P skin
## light/mauve/plum, W/C eye white/iris, R/r headband, N/n/L shorts,
## T/t hand wraps. Walk frames are made by lifting one leg of the stance.

